    "context": "And we're biting and devouring one another. I see there's another thing here, which is they always elevate what's happening to them personally as if it's about the whole church, like globally. There is accountability happening inside charismatic churches to a degree right now. What's really happening right now is not actually not so much accountability as is awareness. Accountability has yet to come. Accountability to Pastor Steve Whitt of Bethel Cleveland for false prop fake prophecy, false prophecy.",
