   {
    "context": "The desire is that if accountability will not rise from the leadership and they're actually creating a culture of cover up, that accountability can be demanded from the people. That's you. You can demand that kind of accountability and that kind of integrity that should be in these ministries because you cannot build your house on the sand of fake prophecy, fake miracles, fake words from the Lord. It's going to fail. And I say, if it's gonna fail, sooner better.",
